 "<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#ff7a1a\">8</span><br><i lang=\"en\" translate=\"no\">has climbed a mountain</i>": "<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#ff7a1a\">8</span><br><i lang=\"en\" translate=\"no\">has climbed a mountain</i>",
 "<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#ff7a1a\">9</span><br><i lang=\"en\" translate=\"no\">has never seen snow</i>": "<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#ff7a1a\">9</span><br><i lang=\"en\" translate=\"no\">has never seen snow</i>",
 "Pregunta <i lang=\"en\" translate=\"no\">Have you ever…?</i> y, si alguien dice que sí, pide un detalle en past simple: <i lang=\"en\" translate=\"no\">When did you…?</i>": "Demande <i lang=\"en\" translate=\"no\">Have you ever…?</i> et, si quelqu'un dit oui, demande un détail au past simple : <i lang=\"en\" translate=\"no\">When did you…?</i>",
